Output public/videos/05-rewind.mp4
Require copilot
Source scripts/recordings/_settings.tape

Hide
Type "copilot --allow-tool=write" Enter
Sleep 4s
Show

Type "Add a one-line welcome comment to the top of README.md" Sleep 600ms Enter
Sleep 12s
Type "! git diff --stat" Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "/rewind" Sleep 600ms Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "! git diff --stat" Enter
Sleep 4s

Hide
Ctrl+C Ctrl+C
